cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ercot-rtcb-bench: An Open Benchmark for Battery Bidding in Post-RTC+B ERCOT"
authors:
  - family-names: Mattu
    given-names: Karthik
date-released: 2026-06-XX
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/karthikmattu06-hue/ercot-rtcb-bench
abstract: >
  An open benchmark and reference bidding stack for ERCOT's Real-Time
  Co-optimization Plus Batteries (RTC+B) market design. Includes versioned
  datasets, reference implementations (perfect-foresight MIP, stochastic MILP,
  SAC, decision-focused learning), and an evaluation harness for rolling-horizon
  backtesting.
keywords:
  - energy storage
  - battery bidding
  - ERCOT
  - electricity markets
  - reinforcement learning
  - optimization
